{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a120f5fa609f18624615bcf6b2fe2705d42743153e67d2a756ca35d98d2954b2", "ja": "あっ、そうだ。会議に出す前に、\n{$P$}さんに意見をもらおうかな？", "zh": "啊，对了。在提交会议之前，先听听{$P$}先生的意见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1e9774e835ef8e4720515a00954ca37d3065811b52ed95443bb77003a59c4857", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\n青羽さん。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "44f37d1555475c016cc656fa2d9b50555f4cfef40fc4c5e70dc6e068d77862a2", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nすごい、ちょうどいいタイミングで……！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n太好了，您来得正是时候……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "1ccad47e94f1e76d8329b729a73d01c8571144bb5450cb398e0cdf257baba7b5", "ja": "あっ……でも社長さんが、事務所に顔を出して\nほしいとも言ってたし……うう、どうしよう！", "zh": "啊……不过社长也说过，希望您能来事务所露个面……呜呜，该怎么办才好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fc0142a0f4185d9f66a9ec8ff55dd00e3a1a887bd26edf4e515f91bcf608ba74", "ja": "社長が？\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』についてかな……。", "zh": "社长？\n该不会是关于『BATTLE OF THEATER』的事吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8757888ca025e47f6fca9f020d6ca77630ecd6b506f63af05ac1eb5b52cc7be3", "ja": "青羽さんは、何か用事でしたか？\nよければ、先に伺いますよ！", "zh": "青羽小姐是有什么事吗？方便的话，我先听你说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "305eeb51fef7845e6397491e0d97b66d6e97089eeeb8ef4624fcb3e2ca35d95a", "ja": "す、すみません！　ありがとうございます。\nあの、もしお時間があったらなんですけど……。", "zh": "不、不好意思！谢谢您。\n那个，如果您有时间的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "c686a21e9a66ecfc646a496a9b2898e9705d7f6d3353faa60e6d94aba24a0128", "ja": "次の会議で提出する予定の、新衣装の企画書に、\n目を通してもらえませんか？", "zh": "可以请您抽空看一下这份准备在下次会议上提交的新服装企划书吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "79058544d54616868112f2387eb12cf8a4f29346884712ed4fea9fc18873ca97", "ja": "もちろん大丈夫ですよ！\n自分でよければいくらでも。", "zh": "当然没问题！\n只要我可以，看多少都行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "22b32048176cd6a8b3d5fa9b5a32f96dcd1f8884d7a266d1ed5fcc6a34141395", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nあの、これなんですけど……！", "zh": "太感谢您了！\n那个，就是这个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "0a42451dad6ab195c18a51e2923c508749849c1fbb8be9d6a647495f55e46267", "ja": "どうですか！？　私の新作、\n日本の歴代人工衛星コーデシリーズ！", "zh": "怎么样！？这是我的新作——\n日本历代人造卫星搭配系列！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "18b1616e0d13156c9ca51fca30ad97918c3eff77d142334cf4280d7c77a799b3", "ja": "マニピュレーターも動作するようにして、\n最終的には船外活動も可能に……！", "zh": "还要让机械臂也能活动，\n最终甚至要能进行舱外活动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508", "ja": "これは……。", "zh": "这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "7309b9d448db4b694493390cf28a8fb55633f4c903e2fe8db57b5dcfb15c5d7b", "ja": "……。\nちょっと、奇抜過ぎましたかね……？", "zh": "……。\n是不是有点，太奇装异服了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1ef80fa41f9900e7cb0756d190d6589a7cee3d0f67a48d70d48f6d36f5893245", "ja": "いえ、個性的な衣装は\n前例が山ほどありますから、そこは……。", "zh": "不，个性十足的服装已经有过很多先例了，所以这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d25d9d7e20874ab56c4efd44ab277e907db9b91591ef0712818b49191cb10838", "ja": "その、アイディアは新規性に溢れていて、\n大変意欲的だなと思うのですが……。", "zh": "那个，这个点子充满新意，\n我觉得确实非常有挑战性，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "4cdf426c11016bcf36aa3d52bedda8105a2b628163da1e38d75650958d536a82", "ja": "はいっ。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1b184ecb00e98f6eedc09a00dc49594e99c29bb1af230f64d0df94c2c3519293", "ja": "完全に被り物なので、アイドルの顔が見えない\n衣装を許容することは難しいかな、と……。", "zh": "因为完全是头套，所以恐怕很难\n容许这种看不到偶像面孔的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "0140b7e9846558e6bed1524012f0b67a8f3e29d8dc73b865a6f6f0b34314f047", "ja": "……はっ！？　そ、そうだった～！　私ったら、\nアイディアを衣装に落とし込む事ばかり考えて……！", "zh": "……哈！？对、对哦～！我都光顾着\n把创意落实到服装上了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f52b3fc157eb51fdd79cd6a0df23d0f5c7e89e06cc20c9588e11d5b88071e0ae", "ja": "でも、エキセントリックで創造性に満ちていて、\n刺激的だと思います！", "zh": "不过，我觉得这既前卫又充满创造力，真的很有刺激性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d65bb53a558decac96b11aeb67c6d5e070cbd2b2c189dd2f6064660b347eb8a9", "ja": "また新しい衣装案ができたら見せてください。\nそれじゃ、行ってきます！", "zh": "等有了新的服装设计方案，再拿给我看看吧。\n那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "ae954eac6666e2133eea41db779d76b3e734f80e4ff1cc0c4abdc58e62ff2787", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございました！\nいってらっしゃ～い！", "zh": "好的，谢谢您！\n路上小心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1023_102mis", "source_sha256": "d2d0f010c36f34e4f09ca94bdbd755a6de029b6515318492b430c01b2c8b5dba", "ja": "アイディアはまだまだあるけど……\nとりあえず今夜ゆっくり寝てから、かな。", "zh": "虽然还有很多点子……但还是先好好睡一觉，明晚再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1024_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "f0ab1dfb2a3e56386aba6ae321bb5d3d445bf1bc8c4954ad69a7d5a7b9cb6bc5", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』シリーズ、\n順調だとは思うが、早速次回についてだ。", "zh": "“BATTLE OF THEATER”系列\n目前进行得挺顺利，不过接下来该讨论下一次了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "265388f09476ebdc57851062cae367e59c25a147ced6aad7d68340b83017e0e3", "ja": "とある番組からオファーをもらっていてね。\n君は、知っているかね？", "zh": "有个节目向我们发来了邀请。你知道这个节目吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "520241a2ce116f6e70f4eccf0ecdeddc006c1d315ab07514cdec5f2863704e29", "ja": "最近話題の、教育番組なんだが……。\nたしか、夕方放送されているんだったかな。", "zh": "最近很受关注的教育节目……\n好像是傍晚播出的来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d2535123eba1f4b7a8fc6e58293dc8bdd5989736214f8bd77187e92b5e69d956", "ja": "もしかして、学生が自分の地元を調査して\nプレゼンで勝負をするという内容の……。", "zh": "难道是那种由学生调查自己的家乡，再通过展示来一决胜负的节目……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "96082eda79190cea5d055787d94f90158885be97708c1aa79c231187be7b52e9", "ja": "うむ！　学生視点での地元の捉え方と、\n白熱するプレゼン対決が見どころの番組だ。", "zh": "嗯！这是一档以学生视角看待家乡，以及精彩激烈的演讲对决为看点的节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "181f394b240c2b68df64fc630c61346809cb8649dc2191be09b1961545c0ba20", "ja": "みんな真剣で、学習意欲にあふれていて、\n若い熱意がとってもまぶしいんですよね～。", "zh": "大家都很认真，充满了求知欲，\n年轻人的那股热情真是太耀眼了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "c54a48e5320ab4454f8fa3bf9b06154b89bbe157c3e4c12d36b20c3bcb6d49bc", "ja": "私が学生のころなんて、こんなに真面目に\n勉強してなかったかも……ピヨヨ……。", "zh": "我上学那会儿，可没这么认真地\n学习过……唧唧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "647125140b1bfdcebc07ebf0ea18119c29df93011c0ff25e8e7d63859ffcdbec", "ja": "このプレゼン番組と『BATTLE OF THEATER』の\n相性がいいのではと連動企画を提案されてね。", "zh": "有人向我提议，认为这个演示节目和『BATTLE OF THEATER』或许很合拍，可以做联动企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a3489297e5da36833808527be6573e0ffff30d780beef06a29f77beb9e6f4b73", "ja": "なるほど。つまり、\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』地元プレゼン対決……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，\n《BATTLE OF THEATER》本地介绍对决……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7f568f28785209731aa12b8254db19a55a6781a51c90b3632d15b3a6a5d92e83", "ja": "次のメンバー候補の、\nひなた、可奈、紬もちょうど学生です。", "zh": "下一批成员候选中的日向、可奈和䌷也正好都是学生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "af52e1fad874df1116ec211ca6c990e52cf1ac33f62413e53d712dc900366e4d", "ja": "3人とも、それぞれ出身地も違うし……\nぴったりですね！", "zh": "她们3个人的出身地也都各不相同……\n真是再合适不过了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1036_101kot", "source_sha256": "7f26ca9c734bc8238f618dcd660f9a2bc68ad5df2f7bfe5c37e196ffc35bba6b", "ja": "ただ、調査もプレゼンもあって準備が\n大変そうですけど……大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "不过，既要调查又要做演示，准备工作好像很辛苦……没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0402_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "d6896bd2f8be1594ac9de55b75b7c293a5cc9e9cc89f3550762a34bb3171a3f8", "ja": "そこは、自分がいますから！\nサポートならいくらでも。", "zh": "这方面有我在呢！  \n要帮忙的话，多少都行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
